💻 Computer Repair Management System (Desktop Application)
A desktop application designed to streamline computer repair services, track repair progress, and manage inventory efficiently.

🧰 Key Features:
Repair Request Logging: Staff can log and monitor repair requests with time-stamped history.

Technician Assignment: Admins can assign and reassign technicians to specific repairs.

Inventory Management: Add, update, delete, and track spare parts used for repairs.

Status Automation: Automated repair stage tracking (e.g., Received → In Progress → Completed).

Customer Management: Record and maintain customer profiles and service history.

Billing Module: Generate repair invoices with automatic part and labor cost calculations.

Repair Summary Reports: Exportable summaries for internal tracking and customer use.

🖥️ Tech Stack:
Frontend/UI: JavaFX for a responsive and intuitive interface

Backend: Java with JDBC for database interaction

Database: MySQL – Real-time data handling with backup support

Architecture: Modular design with separation of concerns (Repair, Inventory, Billing, Customers)

🧠 Skills Demonstrated:
Java Application Development

JavaFX UI/UX Design

MySQL Database Design & Integration

JDBC for DB Connectivity

Object-Oriented Programming

Software Architecture & Modular Design

⚙️ Future Enhancements (Optional Suggestions):
Web version using React.js and Spring Boot or Node.js/Express.js

Cloud backup and remote access

Email notifications on status updates

Role-based login (Admin, Technician, Customer
